Package: coreact
Title: High-Performance Co-Reactivity Analysis
Version: 1.2.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("August F.", "Jernbom", , "ajernbom@jhmi.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7773-1851"))
Description: Optimized pipeline for calculating co-occurrence statistics
    (hypergeometric test, Jaccard index, overlap coefficient) between the
    features of two sparse binary matrices that share the same samples.
    Uses chunked sparse matrix algebra and fork-based parallel processing
    so that millions of feature pairs can be scored on a single node.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/jernbom/coreact
